{"id":3160,"date":"2021-01-27T15:16:17","date_gmt":"2021-01-27T15:16:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/about-us\/gdpr\/"},"modified":"2021-05-20T10:53:13","modified_gmt":"2021-05-20T10:53:13","slug":"gdpr","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/about-us\/gdpr\/","title":{"rendered":"GDPR"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"3160\" class=\"elementor elementor-3160 elementor-244\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d734e99 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d734e99\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0d47aad\" data-id=\"0d47aad\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b88a8cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b88a8cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><u><strong>Nicolet CZ sr.o. e-newsletter &#8211; conditions for processing personal data:<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Personal data manager, according to Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR) is the company <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/about-us\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nicolet CZ s.r.o.<\/a><\/li>\n<li>The protection of personal data complies with the requirements of Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR).<\/li>\n<li>We process personal data in order to inform about news concerning only the subject of business of Nicolet CZ s.r.o., ie. new devices, applications and course or training invitations.<\/li>\n<li>The subject of processing is only <strong>the e-mail address.<\/strong> We will keep this personal data for this purpose for a maximum of 15 years.<\/li>\n<li>We will not provide your personal data to any third party, except for institutions authorized to do so by law.<\/li>\n<li>At any time, you have the right to withdraw your consent to the processing, correction or deletion of personal data, as well as the right to lodge a complaint with the Office for Personal Data Protection if you consider that we are processing contrary to the GDPR. Withdrawal of consent and a request for change must be sent to <strong>info@nicoletcz.cz<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>The administrator has not appointed a data protection officer, has not entrusted the processing of your personal data to any processor or has appointed a representative to perform obligations under the GDPR.<\/li>\n<li>There will be no automated decision-making or profiling when processing your personal data.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you have any questions, do not hesitate to <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/about-us\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">contact us<\/a>.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a0daf4 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"9a0daf4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-520646a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"520646a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><u><strong>General conditions of personal data processing &#8211; customers:<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Personal data manager, according to Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR) is the company <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/about-us\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nicolet CZ s.r.o.<\/a><\/li>\n<li>We process your personal data in order to process your orders and to resolve complaints.<\/li>\n<li>We process your name and surname, delivery address, e-mail, telephone number, bank account number, ordered goods and their price.<\/li>\n<li>The legal reason for this processing is the performance of the contract. For this purpose, we process the stated personal data for the duration of the warranty period, or other contractual obligations.<\/li>\n<li>The protection of your personal data complies with the requirements of Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR).<\/li>\n<li>We provide your personal data only to institutions authorized by law, no one else<\/li>\n<li>We do not provide your personal data without your explicit consent. You can revoke this consent (if given) at any time.<\/li>\n<li>There will be no automated decision-making or profiling when processing your personal data.<\/li>\n<li>We have not appointed a data protection officer, we have not entrusted the processing of your personal data to any processor, nor have we appointed a representative to fulfill obligations under the GDPR.<\/li>\n<li>We do not intend to transfer your personal information to a third country, international organization or other persons.<\/li>\n<li>You have the right to withdraw your consent to the processing of personal data, the right to request access to your personal data, their correction or deletion, or restrictions on processing, and to object to the processing, you have the right to transfer that data to another controller. a complaint to the Office for Personal Data Protection if you consider that we are processing contrary to the GDPR when processing your personal data.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you have any questions, do not hesitate to <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/about-us\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">contact us<\/a>.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Nicolet CZ sr.o. e-newsletter &#8211; conditions for processing personal data: Personal data manager, according to Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR) is the company Nicolet CZ s.r.o. The protection of personal data complies with the requirements of Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR). We process personal data in order to inform about news concerning only the subject of business [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":3135,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3160","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>GDPR - NicoletCZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/about-us\/gdpr\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"GDPR - NicoletCZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Nicolet CZ sr.o. e-newsletter &#8211; conditions for processing personal data: Personal data manager, according to Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR) is the company Nicolet CZ s.r.o. The protection of personal data complies with the requirements of Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR). We process personal data in order to inform about news concerning only the subject of business [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/